    "body": "I wish I remembered why we go in parallel here. We should add a note if we can remember. It seems a bit weird to check the origin stuff while in parallel. I would have expected everything after serialize to be in the queued task, but nothing to be in parallel. Similar to postMessage() for MessagePort.\r\n\r\nAs-is it causes an awkward split where you have to set up all the data ahead of time before going in parallel, then fire the event etc. I guess I can't see a good way around that, unless we're comfortable changing this to be more like MessagePort.",
